    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768233,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wǒ men huì zài zhè ge ruǎn jiàn shàng mǎi piào\nWe buy tickets on this app"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773300,
    "dDurationMs": 10599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rú guǒ zuò fēi jī   wǒ jué de zuì cháng jiàn de ruǎn jiàn shì xié chéng\nIf flying, I think the most common app is Ctrip"
